Luck can go up randomly but down predictably.  So it's easy to tell
zero or max, but anything in between takes going to max and
counting down.  Anyways, the max without a luckstone is 10, with
one is 13.  If you sac and no longer get clovers, then you are maxed.
If you have a luckstone and it isn't cursed, your luck will stick at
maxed.

Thing is, each time you see a clover your luck might have gone up
one or more than one.  Certain actions decrease luck by a known
amount.  So if you target a specific number going up doesn't cut it.
For combat and such higher luck is better but there are diminishing
returns after a while.  Many folks max out their luck because then
they know, not because one extra point makes a big difference.
As long as you never miss, that's enough.

